# [WEB-SEO-2 2026-09-10] www.avatok.ai is a CNAME to the same Pages project as the
# apex, so until now it served a full duplicate of every page (Search Console:
# "Alternative page with proper canonical tag" x6). A canonical tag is a hint;
# a 301 is a rule. Cloudflare Pages evaluates this file before _worker.js.
https://www.avatok.ai/* https://avatok.ai/:splat 301

# [WEB-SEO-2] Retired URLs Google still holds from the pre-pivot site (Search
# Console "Crawled - currently not indexed", 10 URLs, last crawled Jun/Jul
# 2026). Left alone they either 404 or — worse — fall into the /[username]
# mockup catch-all and answer 200 with a demo profile. A 301 to the page that
# replaced them hands over whatever link equity they had and clears the report.
/videos                       /marketplace   301
/video-sessions/*             /marketplace   301
/live-events/*                /marketplace   301
/creator-resources            /ideas         301
/creator-resources/*          /ideas         301
/how-it-works                 /about         301
/coming-soon                  /              301
